    "body": "I looked at my ```PROMPT_COMMAND``` since it was mentioned and It seems ```history -a``` get's called before ```starship_precmd```. I looked into it and it seems sensible.bash adds it, so I'll tweak it. Setting it just to ```starship_precmd``` works just fine.\r\n\r\n![2020-02-26-144444_248x80_scrot](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/51170833/75346067-907abe00-58a6-11ea-8718-6745d950bd09.png)\r\n\r\nMy issue was resolved, would it be correct to close this issue (sorry this is the first time I ever opened an issue)?\r\n",
